'''Curitiba''' (from {{Langx|tpn|kurí tyba|4=many pine seeds}}) is an urban Baliscan [[Cantons of Balisca|canton]], located in the [[Karuãguasu]] region of [[Araucaria]]. The commune had an estimated population of 1,195,562 as of 1 May 2023. It straddles the [[Río Kuevá]] ("dark river").   

